{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>80歲的美國作家Bill Sniffin駕駛一輛2018款二手特斯拉Model X完成了近3000英裏（約4800公裏）的長途旅行，其中約2800英裏（約4500公裏）由特斯拉FSD輔助駕駛系統完成。</strong>Sniffin是懷俄明州Cowboy State Daily的專欄作家，也是資深科技產品嘗鮮者。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/movie/1584016.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T10:01:44.528524+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T09:44:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T09:58:19.464434+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T09:58:19.464434+00:00","content_hash":"1b2f2f77bf44bdf0cce0bfbafa79f3b208990710b3bc2306d913b41487a8e4de","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}